# Idle return (apps/launcher.md): an app nobody touches for a minute is left for the launcher; a book stays open; the
# setting on Settings > Power.
wait 300
tap 100 424             # Mail tile
wait 59000
shot idle-home-before   # 59 s without a touch: still Mail
wait 2500
shot idle-home-launcher # a minute: the launcher, by itself (settled)
tap 100 248             # Read tile: books (and games) stay open
wait 300000
shot idle-home-read-stays
back
wait 900
tap 270 424             # Settings
wait 900
tap 270 364             # Power
wait 900
tap 72 322              # back to home when unused for: Never
wait 400000
shot idle-home-never    # still Settings > Power
